<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>PetSwipe – Matching responsable de mascotas</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --rojo: #C41E3A;
      --verde: #2E7D32;
      --gris-suave: #F5F5F7;
      --gris-texto: #6B7280;
      --texto: #1F2937;
      --blanco: #FFFFFF;
      --sombra: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    }

    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
      background: #E5E7EB;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    /* Marco del iPhone */
    .phone {
      width: 390px;
      height: 844px;
      background: #000;
      border-radius: 48px;
      padding: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .phone-inner {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      background: var(--blanco);
      border-radius: 38px;
      overflow: hidden;
      position: relative;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    /* Notch */
    .notch {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      width: 160px;
      height: 34px;
      background: #000;
      border-radius: 0 0 20px 20px;
      z-index: 100;
    }

    /* Status bar */
    .status-bar {
      height: 50px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 0 24px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--texto);
      background: var(--blanco);
      z-index: 50;
    }

    /* Pantallas */
    .screen {
      display: none;
      flex: 1;
      flex-direction: column;
      overflow-y: auto;
      background: var(--blanco);
      position: relative;
    }

    .screen.active {
      display: flex;
    }

    /* ===== SPLASH ===== */
    .splash {
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 40px 30px;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FFF5F5 0%, #FFFFFF 100%);
    }

    .splash .logo {
      width: 90px;
      height: 90px;
      background: var(--rojo);
      border-radius: 28px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(196, 30, 58, 0.25);
    }

    .splash .logo svg {
      width: 50px;
      height: 50px;
      fill: white;
    }

    .splash h1 {
      font-size: 32px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--rojo);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .splash p {
      font-size: 16px;
      color: var(--gris-texto);
      margin-bottom: 48px;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--rojo);
      color: white;
      border: none;
      padding: 16px 32px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      font-size: 17px;
      font-weight: 600;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 280px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: transform 0.15s, box-shadow 0.15s;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(196, 30, 58, 0.3);
    }

    .btn-primary:active {
      transform: scale(0.98);
    }

    /* ===== HEADER COMÚN ===== */
    .header {
      padding: 12px 20px 16px;
      background: var(--blanco);
      border-bottom: 1px solid #F3F4F6;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .header .back {
      width: 36px;
      height: 36px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--gris-suave);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .header h2 {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--texto);
      flex: 1;
    }

    /* ===== FORMULARIO ESTILO DE VIDA ===== */
    .form-content {
      padding: 20px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .form-group label {
      display: block;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--texto);
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .form-group input,
    .form-group select,
    .form-group textarea {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      border: 1.5px solid #E5E7EB;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-family: inherit;
      background: var(--blanco);
      color: var(--texto);
      outline: none;
      transition: border-color 0.2s;
    }

    .form-group input:focus,
    .form-group select:focus,
    .form-group textarea:focus {
      border-color: var(--rojo);
    }

    .form-group textarea {
      min-height: 80px;
      resize: none;
    }

    .radio-group {
      display: flex;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .radio-option {
      flex: 1;
      padding: 12px;
      border: 1.5px solid #E5E7EB;
      border-radius: 12px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 500;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }

    .radio-option.active {
      border-color: var(--rojo);
      background: #FEF2F2;
      color: var(--rojo);
    }

    .btn-fixed {
      padding: 16px 20px 28px;
      background: var(--blanco);
      border-top: 1px solid #F3F4F6;
    }

    /* ===== MATCHES ===== */
    .matches-list {
      padding: 16px 20px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .pet-card {
      background: var(--blanco);
      border-radius: 20px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: var(--sombra);
      border: 1px solid #F3F4F6;
    }

    .pet-card img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 180px;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    .pet-card-body {
      padding: 16px;
    }

    .pet-card-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .pet-card h3 {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--texto);
    }

    .compat {
      background: #E8F5E9;
      color: var(--verde);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 20px;
    }

    .pet-meta {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--gris-texto);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .pet-desc {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: var(--texto);
      line-height: 1.4;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .fundacion {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--gris-texto);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 4px;
    }

    .fundacion::before {
      content: "✓";
      color: var(--verde);
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    /* ===== DETALLE MASCOTA ===== */
    .detail-hero {
      width: 100%;
      height: 280px;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    .detail-content {
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .detail-title {
      font-size: 26px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--texto);
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .detail-tags {
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .tag {
      background: var(--gris-suave);
      color: var(--texto);
      font-size: 13px;
      padding: 6px 12px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .section {
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .section h4 {
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--texto);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .section p, .section ul {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: var(--gris-texto);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .section ul {
      list-style: none;
    }

    .section li {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .section li::before {
      content: "✓";
      color: var(--verde);
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    /* ===== PROCESO ADOPCIÓN ===== */
    .process-content {
      padding: 30px 24px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .success-icon {
      width: 80px;
      height: 80px;
      background: #E8F5E9;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin: 0 auto 20px;
      font-size: 36px;
    }

    .process-content h2 {
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--texto);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .process-content > p {
      font-size: 15px;
      color: var(--gris-texto);
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    .steps {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      position: relative;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .steps::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: 18px;
      left: 30px;
      right: 30px;
      height: 3px;
      background: #E5E7EB;
      z-index: 0;
    }

    .step {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      z-index: 1;
      width: 70px;
    }

    .step-circle {
      width: 36px;
      height: 36px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #E5E7EB;
      color: var(--gris-texto);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .step.active .step-circle {
      background: var(--verde);
      color: white;
    }

    .step.completed .step-circle {
      background: var(--verde);
      color: white;
    }

    .step span {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--gris-texto);
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .step.active span {
      color: var(--verde);
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .info-box {
      background: #F0FDF4;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 16px;
      text-align: left;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: var(--texto);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    /* ===== SEGUIMIENTO ===== */
    .follow-content {
      padding: 24px 20px;
    }

    .timeline-item {
      display: flex;
      gap: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      position: relative;
    }

    .timeline-item:not(:last-child)::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      left: 15px;
      top: 36px;
      bottom: -24px;
      width: 2px;
      background: #E5E7EB;
    }

    .timeline-dot {
      width: 32px;
      height: 32px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #E5E7EB;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 14px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .timeline-item.completed .timeline-dot {
      background: var(--verde);
      color: white;
    }

    .timeline-item.current .timeline-dot {
      background: var(--rojo);
      color: white;
    }

    .timeline-body h4 {
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .timeline-body p {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--gris-texto);
    }

    /* ===== HOME / PERFIL ===== */
    .profile-header {
      padding: 24px 20px;
      text-align: center;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FFF5F5 0%, #FFFFFF 100%);
    }

    .avatar {
      width: 80px;
      height: 80px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--rojo);
      color: white;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin: 0 auto 12px;
    }

    .profile-header h2 {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .profile-header p {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: var(--gris-texto);
    }

    .home-cards {
      padding: 0 20px 20px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .home-card {
      background: var(--blanco);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 16px;
      box-shadow: var(--sombra);
      border: 1px solid #F3F4F6;
    }

    .home-card h3 {
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .home-card .count {
      background: var(--gris-suave);
      color: var(--texto);
      font-size: 12px;
      padding: 2px 8px;
      border-radius: 10px;
    }

    .mini-pets {
      display: flex;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .mini-pet {
      width: 60px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .mini-pet img {
      width: 56px;
      height: 56px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      object-fit: cover;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .mini-pet span {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--gris-texto);
    }

    /* Navegación inferior del prototipo */
    .proto-nav {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      background: #111;
      display: flex;
      overflow-x: auto;
      padding: 8px 4px;
      gap: 4px;
      z-index: 200;
    }

    .proto-nav button {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 70px;
      background: #222;
      color: #aaa;
      border: none;
      padding: 8px 4px;
      font-size: 10px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      cursor: pointer;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .proto-nav button.active {
      background: var(--rojo);
      color: white;
    }

    /* Ajuste para que el contenido no quede detrás del nav */
    .screen {
      padding-bottom: 60px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="phone">
  <div class="phone-inner">
    <div class="notch"></div>

    <!-- ==================== 1. SPLASH ==================== -->
    <div class="screen active" id="screen-1">
      <div class="status-bar">
        <span>9:41</span>
        <span>●●●● WiFi</span>
      </div>
      <div class="splash">
        <div class="logo">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2C10.9 2 10 2.9 10 4C10 5.1 10.9 6 12 6C13.1 6 14 5.1 14 4C14 2.9 13.1 2 12 2ZM8.5 6C7.12 6 6 7.12 6 8.5C6 9.88 7.12 11 8.5 11C9.88 11 11 9.88 11 8.5C11 7.12 9.88 6 8.5 6ZM15.5 6C14.12 6 13 7.12 13 8.5C13 9.88 14.12 11 15.5 11C16.88 11 18 9.88 18 8.5C18 7.12 16.88 6 15.5 6ZM4.5 11C3.12 11 2 12.12 2 13.5C2 14.88 3.12 16 4.5 16C5.88 16 7 14.88 7 13.5C7 12.12 5.88 11 4.5 11ZM19.5 11C18.12 11 17 12.12 17 13.5C17 14.88 18.12 16 19.5 16C20.88 16 22 14.88 22 13.5C22 12.12 20.88 11 19.5 11ZM12 13C9.24 13 7 15.24 7 18V20H17V18C17 15.24 14.76 13 12 13Z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h1>PetSwipe</h1>
        <p>Matching responsable de mascotas</p>
        <button class="btn-primary" onclick="goTo(2)">Comenzar</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ==================== 2. FORMULARIO ESTILO DE VIDA ==================== -->
    <div class="screen" id="screen-2">
      <div class="status-bar">
        <span>9:41</span>
        <span>●●●● WiFi</span>
      </div>
      <div class="header">
        <div class="back" onclick="goTo(1)">←</div>
        <h2>Tu estilo de vida</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="form-content">
        <div class="form-group">
          <label>Edad</label>
          <input type="number" placeholder="Ej: 28" value="28">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label>Ciudad / Comuna</label>
          <input type="text" value="Talca, Maule">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label>Tipo de vivienda</label>
          <div class="radio-group">
            <div class="radio-option active" onclick="selectRadio(this)">Casa</div>
            <div class="radio-option" onclick="selectRadio(this)">Departamento</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label>Ingreso líquido aproximado</label>
          <select>
            <option>$400.000 - $600.000</option>
            <option selected>$600.000 - $900.000</option>
            <option>$900.000 - $1.200.000</option>
            <option>Más de $1.200.000</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label>Horas semanales disponibles para la mascota</label>
          <input type="number" value="15" placeholder="Ej: 12">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label>¿Qué buscas en una mascota?</label>
          <textarea>Compañía, alguien tranquilo que se adapte a mi rutina de trabajo</textarea>
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label>¿Qué puedes ofrecerle a la mascota?</label>
          <textarea>Tiempo de calidad, paseos diarios, alimentación balanceada y mucho cariño</textarea>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="btn-fixed">
        <button class="btn-primary" onclick="goTo(3)">Ver mis matches</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ==================== 3. RESULTADOS MATCHING ==================== -->
    <div class="screen" id="screen-3">
      <div class="status-bar">
        <span>9:41</span>
        <span>●●●● WiFi</span>
      </div>
      <div class="header">
        <div class="back" onclick="goTo(2)">←</div>
        <h2>Tus matches compatibles</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="matches-list">
        <!-- Card 1 -->
        <div class="pet-card" onclick="goTo(4)">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1587300003388-59208cc962cb?w=600&h=400&fit=crop" alt="Max">
          <div class="pet-card-body">
            <div class="pet-card-header">
              <h3>Max</h3>
              <span class="compat">94% compatible</span>
            </div>
            <div class="pet-meta">3 años · Macho · Mediano</div>
            <div class="pet-desc">Tranquilo, sociable y muy cariñoso. Ideal para familias o personas que buscan compañía leal.</div>
            <div class="fundacion">Fundación Huellitas Talca</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- Card 2 -->
        <div class="pet-card">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1514888286974-6c03e2ca1dba?w=600&h=400&fit=crop" alt="Luna">
          <div class="pet-card-body">
            <div class="pet-card-header">
              <h3>Luna</h3>
              <span class="compat">89% compatible</span>
            </div>
            <div class="pet-meta">2 años · Hembra · Pequeña</div>
            <div class="pet-desc">Juguetona y curiosa. Se adapta muy bien a departamentos y es ideal para dueños primerizos.</div>
            <div class="fundacion">Protectora Animal Maule</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- Card 3 -->
        <div class="pet-card">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1552053831-71594a27632d?w=600&h=400&fit=crop" alt="Toby">
          <div class="pet-card-body">
            <div class="pet-card-header">
              <h3>Toby</h3>
              <span class="compat">87% compatible</span>
            </div>
            <div class="pet-meta">4 años · Macho · Grande</div>
            <div class="pet-desc">Energético y leal. Perfecto para personas activas que disfrutan de paseos largos.</div>
            <div class="fundacion">Fundación Amigos de los Animales</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ==================== 4. DETALLE MASCOTA ==================== -->
    <div class="screen" id="screen-4">
      <div class="status-bar">
        <span>9:41</span>
        <span>●●●● WiFi</span>
      </div>
      <img class="detail-hero" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1587300003388-59208cc962cb?w=800&h=600&fit=crop" alt="Max">
      <div class="detail-content">
        <div class="detail-title">Max</div>
        <div class="detail-tags">
          <span class="tag">3 años</span>
          <span class="tag">Macho</span>
          <span class="tag">Mediano</span>
          <span class="tag" style="background:#E8F5E9;color:var(--verde)">94% match</span>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
          <h4>Temperamento</h4>
          <p>Tranquilo, sociable y muy cariñoso. Se lleva bien con personas y otros perros. Ideal para dueños que buscan compañía leal sin excesiva energía.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
          <h4>Convivencia</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>Compatible con niños</li>
            <li>Se lleva bien con otras mascotas</li>
            <li>Adaptado a casa con patio</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
          <h4>Estado de salud</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>Esterilizado</li>
            <li>Vacunas al día</li>
            <li>Microchip instalado</li>
            <li>Desparasitado</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
          <h4>Su historia</h4>
          <p>Max llegó a la fundación hace 4 meses. Es un perro rescatado de la calle que ha demostrado ser extremadamente agradecido y leal. Está listo para encontrar su hogar definitivo.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
          <h4>Publicado por</h4>
          <p style="color:var(--verde);font-weight:500">✓ Fundación Huellitas Talca</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="btn-fixed">
        <button class="btn-primary" onclick="goTo(5)">Quiero conocerlo</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ==================== 5. PROCESO DE ADOPCIÓN ==================== -->
    <div class="screen" id="screen-5">
